WEBVTT

00:13:28.677 --> 00:13:30.014
who'd never done the task,

00:13:30.038 --> 00:13:32.670
thinking that maybe they would have
a stronger reaction,

00:13:32.694 --> 00:13:34.233
and that turned out to be right.

00:13:34.257 --> 00:13:36.753
The one on the left is the monkey
who gets cucumber.

00:13:36.777 --> 00:13:39.036
The one on the right
is the one who gets grapes.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.407
The one who gets cucumber --

00:13:40.431 --> 00:13:43.141
note that the first piece
of cucumber is perfectly fine.

00:13:43.251 --> 00:13:44.976
The first piece she eats.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.605
Then she sees the other one getting grape,
and you will see what happens.

00:13:49.294 --> 00:13:51.873
So she gives a rock to us.
That's the task.

00:13:51.897 --> 00:13:54.955
And we give her a piece
of cucumber and she eats it.

00:13:54.979 --> 00:13:56.976
The other one needs to give a rock to us.

00:13:58.188 --> 00:13:59.976
And that's what she does.